#: tips.cpp:3
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"10\" align=\"center\">\n"
"<tr>\n"
"<td>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/32x32/apps/digikamimageplugins.png\">\n"
"</td>\n"
"<td>\n"
"Did you know that you can keep a zone clear of raindrops with the\n"
"'Select' tool? Selecting the area to avoid (for example a face) before\n"
"launching the 'RainDrops' filter will keep it free from rain drops.\n"
"</td>\n"
"</tr>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"10\" align=\"center\">\n"
"<tr>\n"
"<td>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/32x32/apps/digikamimageplugins.png\">\n"
"</td>\n"
"<td>\n"
"Adakah anda tahun yang anda boleh menetapkan zon bebas titis hujan dengan "
"menggunakan\n"
"alatan 'Pilihan'? Memilih kawasan untuk dielakkan (contohnya muka) sebelum\n"
"melaksanakan tapisan 'TitisHujan' akan menyebabkannya bebas dari titis hujan.\n"
"</td>\n"
"</tr>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:21
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"10\" align=\"center\">\n"
"<tr>\n"
"<td>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/32x32/apps/digikamimageplugins.png\">\n"
"</td>\n"
"<td>\n"
"Did you know that you can simulate the graininess of black-and-white photos "
"with the 'FilmGrain' image editor plugin.\n"
"</td>\n"
"</tr>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"10\" align=\"center\">\n"
"<tr>\n"
"<td>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/32x32/apps/digikamimageplugins.png\">\n"
"</td>\n"
"<td>\n"
"Adakah anda tahu yang anda boleh mensimulasikan titik-titik gambar hitam putih "
"dengan plugin editor imej 'FilmGrain'.\n"
"</td>\n"
"</tr>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</p>\n"
